    "destination": "/about/goals",
    "categories": [],
    "tags": [],
    "excerpt": "1. Vesak White House OutreachReach out to Congress and Senators who are Buddhist inclined to write a letter of endorsement VIP or celebrities to write a letter of endorsement (Asian American) Temples across the United States to send letters 2. Outreach to Buddhist Communities in USAAgree list of US heads of each religious tradition to […]",
    "body": [
      "1. Vesak White House Outreach\nReach out to Congress and Senators who are Buddhist inclined to write a letter of endorsement VIP or celebrities to write a letter of endorsement (Asian American) Temples across the United States to send letters",
      "2. Outreach to Buddhist Communities in USA\nAgree list of US heads of each religious tradition to be contacted along with heads of different nikayas if necessary (Thai, Sri Lankan, Cambodian, Burmese, Korean, Laotian, Vietnamese, Indian, Chinese, Taiwanese, Japanese, Tibetan, Nepali, Bhutanese, Mongolian, Bangladeshi, Indonesian and Western, (2200 temples and meditation centers in USA and their respective heads).",
      "“Reach out to all Embassies who are Buddhist and to get a letter endorsing lighting of candle inside White House in May 2018”",
      "3. International Consortium of Buddhist Pilgrimage from USA\nTo publicize the material to our Tipitaka chanting program audiences, magazines, and lay devotees from each respective temple presentations on the materials will be done by all IBAA group",
      "4. International Tipitaka Chanting Ceremonies (West and East Coast)\nEast Coast: June 8th, 9th, 10th 2017 (Dighanikaya Sutras)\nWest Coast: September 22nd, 23rd, 24th, 2017 (Dighanikaya Sutras)",
      "5. Educational Committee\nTo develop and publish a book with all three yanas (traditions) for the purpose of schools in America. Buddhist camps (outreach to schools on mindfulness/meditation) and adopting the five precepts program in schools across USA"
    ],
